  "description": "The binding named **myBinding** connects the GSLB service group **sg1** to the server identified as **srv-01** at IP address **192.168.1.10** (CIDR **192.168.1.10/32**). The primary service type is **HTTP** on port **80**, with a duplicate service configured on port **443** using **TCP**. AppFlow logging is enabled, and down\u2011state flushing is also enabled. Client IP insertion is disabled, though the custom header **X-Client-IP** is defined for potential use. The binding reports a bound traffic distribution of **5** and a server state of **UP** with a server\u2011side timeout of **30** seconds.  \n\nThe maximum client capacity is set to **500**, the maximum request limit to **10,000**, and the maximum bandwidth to **1000**\u202fkbps. A client timeout (clttimeout) of **180** seconds is configured, and the monitoring threshold is **90**\u202fpercent before the server is considered down. The configuration flags are zero, indicating default settings, and the health\u2011monitoring timeout aligns with the client timeout of **180** seconds. All other parameters reflect the values listed above."
